{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>For, etc.</b> The sense: even though Israel will be numerous in those days like the sand of the sea, only he who returns to HaShem will remain of them, for a decreed destruction is decreed by HaShem, like אתה חרצת (1 Kings 20:40); it will come like an overflowing torrent in righteousness."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:53:15.881795474Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}